      "why": "The confirmatory headline aggregates over leading-flagged panel entries; the stale flag from the pre-lock draft inserted a phantom never-run model row (not_established) into the headline. Registry data correction only; no grades, prompts, routing or judged values change; metrics re-run locally at zero cost"
    },
