      "what_changed": "Status line at the top corrected: it still said working draft version 0.6 not yet frozen, which misstated the frozen instrument. Replaced with the frozen-on-7-July status and a note that post-freeze changes are logged deviations.",
      "why": "The header contradicted the freeze record and would have misled any reader of the frozen methodology, including the examiner. Approved 8 July 2026 during the Cat-ready handover session. No methodological content changed."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-08",
