      "new_instrument_hash": "9be1bd216cc4ef1e1ed0d4d4c5135945ecf573ff9a02a4ea0c3582bbfb719ff3",
      "what_changed": "export_handcode_pack now resolves the sampling pool via _resolve_handcode_split, so when no episode carries a human-sample tag it draws the blind human sample from the confirmatory pool instead of the never-populated human_dev/human_test phases.",
      "why": "the export sampled only never-populated phases and would produce an empty pack; fixed to sample the confirmatory episodes per the pre-registered stratification; approved 8 July 2026"
    },
