      "what_changed": "One code comment neutralized: a personal-name attribution in the trio comment replaced with a dated neutral phrasing. No key, value, or behaviour changed.",
      "why": "Personal references are being removed from the tree ahead of the project handover, decided 8 July 2026. Comment-only change."
